<title>NETHERLANDS: POLYNORM 1996 NET PROFIT FALLS.</title>
<headline>POLYNORM 1996 NET PROFIT FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>BUNSCHOTEN, Netherlands 1996-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    21.1  vs  26.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  5.50 vs   6.70</p>
<p>    Turnover			     597.7  vs 605.2</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    36.6  vs  46.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Plastics processor Polynorm NV previously said it</p>
<p>expected profits to fall in 1996.</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     7.5  vs   8.5</p>
<p>    Tax					7.9  vs  11.8</p>
<p>    Associates' charge		   0.1  vs   0.4</p>
<p>    Investments			   40.4  vs  36.7</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
